&lt;p&gt;Beyond delivering revenue, you&#39;ll help build and scale the Brand Activation function by developing repeatable onboarding processes, activation playbooks and best practices that enable LTK to support increasing brand demand while delivering a consistent, high-quality partner experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly commercial, cross-functional role suited to someone who enjoys building relationships, improving processes and helping brands unlock long-term value through creator commerce.&lt;/p&gt;
